-- Coassociativity in the map form `map duplicate (duplicate w)` does not
-- hold by refl at a variable w (S4 K5 (a)); the form
-- `extend duplicate w` holds (examples/cocell.lang).
def com : (X : Type 0) -> (w : StreamK X) -> Path (StreamK (StreamK (StreamK X))) (map duplicate (duplicate w)) (duplicate (duplicate w)) := fun X w => refl
